# Foolish Fate: "that creature's controller" loses the 3 life, not the opponent and not the caster as such -- Bot1 destroys its own Ornithopter
# after Lightning Helix gained 3 (Bot1 23), so Bot1 itself loses 3 (20) while Bot2 is only hit by the Helix (17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Lightning Helix
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Foolish Fate
Ornithopter
Swamp x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x20

[Actions]
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
